        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="BigNumber is the immutable high-precision number at the heart of JustMath (extends Number, implements Comparable, Cloneable). Its instance methods are thin wrappers that delegate the actual arithmetic to static helper classes in package math.*. Roots, logarithms and trigonometry ultimately call the external BigDecimalMath. MathContext (default precision 100, RoundingMode.HALF_UP) governs precision throughout." vertex="1">
